msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "入门教程"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/index.md:10
msgid ""
"Follow one fixed, verifiable path. Start by creating an external application"
" from a fixed template and running its Native model. SDK packaging and "
"consumer verification are separate maintainer tasks. Use the request "
"tutorial before adding asynchronous execution."
msgstr ""
"沿一条固定且可验证的路径学习。先从固定模板创建外部应用并运行 Native 模型。SDK "
"打包和消费验证是独立的维护者任务。增加异步执行之前先学习请求教程。"
